  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to develop methodology for aggregated results follow-up of    support via civila society partners.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The assignment to create a methodology to aggregate changes/results from our partnerships with civil society actors was decided for procurement (Decision 40/2015) and later a decision for contractor was made (72/2015) - giving the Contract to Doing the Rights Thing. The contributions was initially set up as a Programme Development Fund component in 2015 but needs to be transformed into a Contribution on its own for the remaining work that needs to be done in the beginning of 2016.</narrative>
